<title>HONG KONG: HK weather- cloudy, rain patches, max 24 C.</title>
<headline>HK weather- cloudy, rain patches, max 24 C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>It will be cloudy with rain patches at first but sunny periods during the day, the Royal Observatory said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The maximum temperature will reach about 24 C.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m. the temperature was 21 C and the relative humidity 61 per cent.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6369</p>
</text>
